{
  "slug": "runway-api-skills",
  "name": "Runway Api Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "These skills are designed to help implement Runway's API for you. Integrate image, video, audio, or even live talking characters easily with the Runway API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `rw-api-reference` (Complete reference for Runway's public API: models, endpoints, costs, limits, and types), `rw-check-compatibility` (Analyze a user's codebase to verify it can use Runway's public API (server-side requirement)), `rw-check-org-details` (Query the Runway API for organization details: rate limits, credit balance, usage tier, and daily generation counts), `rw-fetch-api-reference` (Retrieve the latest Runway API reference from docs.dev.runwayml.com and use it as the authoritative source before any integration…), `rw-generate-audio` (Generate audio using the Runway API via runnable scripts), `rw-generate-image` (Generate images directly using the Runway API via runnable scripts), `rw-generate-video` (Generate videos directly using the Runway API via runnable scripts), `rw-integrate-audio` (Help users integrate Runway audio APIs (TTS, sound effects, voice isolation, dubbing)), and 9 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install runway-api-skills@claude-community` from `runwayml/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
